                "text": "Today, I voted to pass the historic One Big Beautiful Bill. It\u2019s a big win for families, small businesses, and the future of our economy.\n\n\u2705 Secures the border\n\u2705 Cuts red tape\n\u2705 Lowers energy costs\n\u2705 Protects Medicaid and SNAP\n\u2705 Makes tax cuts permanent\nRead my full statement below. \u2b07\ufe0f\n\n#OBBB #AR02",
