                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Had the chance to visit the Divine Mercy Health Center in Little Rock last week\u2014an incredible operation with an innovative membership model.\n\nThis faith-inspired nonprofit is making a real difference and increasing access to healthcare right here in central Arkansas. For a small monthly fee, patients get access to primary care, mental health screening, addiction counseling, and more.\n\nThanks to Dr. Lee, Lori Wilbur, and the DMHC team for showing me around!\n\n#AR02 #dmhc #Arkansas #health #LittleRock #DivineMercyHealthCenter",
