                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I submitted testimony to the Congressional Record on how to improve Social Security Disability Insurance, including the need to remove barriers for Americans with disabilities who want to work. As I wrote in my remarks: \"SSDI recipients understandably fear the consequences of losing their benefits if they return to work in any capacity...Congress must address these hurdles so that those with more short-term disabilities can more easily return to work.\"\n\nThank you @RepNateMoran for introducing my Statement for the Record at today's @WaysandMeansGOP hearing on supporting opportunities for individuals with disabilities to work.\n\nYou can read my full remarks here\u27a1\ufe0fhttps://t.co/EE56Lz74Xd",
